<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="google-site-verification" content="Zsy115GXNR37_JF4ZPey81ZaSfTnAe99_ylcmgt2k1s" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ikampu — Tents Built for the Ground You Sleep On</title>

<!-- 
  DESIGN NOTES (for future edits):
  - Palette: deep pine (#16241C bg), mid pine (#28392F cards), canvas cream (#F3EEE0 text),
    ember orange (#E37B4C accent/CTA), sage (#8CA88A secondary), tan (#C9A876 tertiary/specs)
  - Display type: 'Oswald' (condensed, poster/topo-map feel) — body: 'Source Serif 4' (warm, readable)
  - Utility/spec type: 'JetBrains Mono' (used for numbers — weight, capacity, price)
  - Signature element: topographic contour-line dividers between sections, and terrain-elevation
    badges on each product instead of arbitrary 01/02/03 numbering — the badge tells you WHERE
    that tent is meant to be pitched, which is real information a buyer needs.
-->

<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="apple-touch-icon.png">
<meta name="description" content="Ikampu — camping tents and shelters in Kenya, chosen by terrain. Order on WhatsApp.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Ikampu">
<meta property="og:title" content="Ikampu — Tents Built for the Ground You Sleep On">
<meta property="og:description" content="Camping tents and shelters in Kenya. Pick the terrain, order on WhatsApp.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://ikampu.co.ke/">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://ikampu.co.ke/og-image.png">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://ikampu.co.ke/og-image.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  /* ---------- Design tokens ---------- */
  :root{
    --pine-deep: #16241C;
    --pine-mid:  #223225;
    --pine-card: #28392F;
    --cream:     #F3EEE0;
    --cream-dim: #C9C4B3;
    --ember:     #E37B4C;
    --ember-dim: #b5603a;
    --sage:      #8CA88A;
    --tan:       #C9A876;
    --line:      rgba(243,238,224,0.12);

    --display: 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    --body:    'Source Serif 4', serif;
    --mono:    'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }

  html{ scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body{
    background: var(--pine-deep);
    color: var(--cream);
    font-family: var(--body);
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* Respect reduced motion preference */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{ animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; }
  }

  a{ color: inherit; }

  .wrap{
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
  }

  /* ---------- Topographic contour background (signature texture) ---------- */
  .contour-bg{
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.35;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ---------- Nav ---------- */
  header{
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(22,36,28,0.9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  nav.wrap{
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 76px;
  }
  .brand{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--cream);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .brand svg{ flex-shrink: 0; }
  .brand-logo{ height: 64px; width: auto; display: block; }
  footer .brand-logo{ height: 52px; }

  /* Product photos inside cards */
  .tent-icon img{ width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; border-radius: 2px; }
  .tent-icon.has-photo{ padding: 0; height: 190px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: #1c2e21; }
  .thumbs{ position: absolute; right: 8px; bottom: 8px; display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .thumbs button{
    width: 38px; height: 38px; padding: 0; border: 2px solid rgba(243,238,224,0.5);
    border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; background: none; opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .thumbs button.active{ border-color: var(--ember); opacity: 1; }
  .thumbs button img{ width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .tent-icon.contain{ background: #fff; }
  .tent-icon.contain .main-img{ object-fit: contain; }
  .desc-sub{ flex-grow: 0 !important; margin-bottom: 10px !important; color: var(--tan) !important; font-family: var(--display); letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 13px !important; }
  .highlights{ list-style: none; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-grow: 1; }
  .highlights li{ font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--cream-dim); padding-left: 18px; position: relative; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .highlights li::before{ content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.62em; width: 8px; height: 1px; background: var(--ember); }
  .nav-links{
    display: flex;
    gap: 36px;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .nav-links a{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--cream-dim);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a:focus-visible{ color: var(--ember); }

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 0 100px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero .wrap{ position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sage);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content: "";
    width: 28px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--sage);
  }
  h1{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 6.5vw, 84px);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    max-width: 15ch;
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  h1 em{
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--ember);
  }
  .hero-sub{
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 19px;
    max-width: 46ch;
    color: var(--cream-dim);
  }
  .hero-cta{
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .btn{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 16px 30px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    background: var(--ember);
    color: var(--pine-deep);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover, .btn-primary:focus-visible{
    background: var(--cream);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .btn-ghost{
    border-color: var(--line);
    color: var(--cream-dim);
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover, .btn-ghost:focus-visible{
    border-color: var(--sage);
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  .btn:focus-visible{ outline: 2px solid var(--ember); outline-offset: 3px; }

  .hero-stats{
    margin-top: 72px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, auto);
    gap: 48px;
    max-width: 620px;
  }
  .stat-num{
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 30px;
    color: var(--tan);
  }
  .stat-label{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cream-dim);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ---------- Contour divider (signature element) ---------- */
  .contour-divider{
    width: 100%;
    height: 64px;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ---------- Section shell ---------- */
  section{ position: relative; padding: 90px 0; }
  .section-head{
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .section-title{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    color: var(--cream);
  }
  .section-note{
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--cream-dim);
    max-width: 40ch;
  }

  /* ---------- Catalog grid ---------- */
  .catalog{
    background: var(--pine-mid);
  }
  .grid{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .card{
    background: var(--pine-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .card:hover{
    border-color: var(--sage);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }
  .card-top{
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .terrain-badge{
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--pine-deep);
    background: var(--tan);
    padding: 5px 9px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .tent-icon{
    width: 100%;
    height: 150px;
    margin: 6px 0 20px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 10px 0;
  }
  .tent-icon svg{ width: 78%; height: 78%; }
  .card h3{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .card p.desc{
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--cream-dim);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
  .specs{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .spec-label{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--sage);
  }
  .spec-val{
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .card-footer{
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: auto;
  }
  .price{
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--tan);
  }
  .card-cta{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ember);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ember);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
  .card-cta:hover, .card-cta:focus-visible{ opacity: 0.75; }

  /* ---------- Why section ---------- */
  .why-grid{
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .why-item .why-icon{
    width: 44px; height: 44px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .why-item h4{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .why-item p{
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--cream-dim);
  }

  /* ---------- Contact / CTA band ---------- */
  .contact-band{
    background: var(--pine-mid);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 100px 0;
  }
  .contact-band h2{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 52px);
    color: var(--cream);
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
  }
  .contact-band p{
    color: var(--cream-dim);
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
  footer{
    padding: 48px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  footer .wrap{
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  footer .brand{ font-size: 16px; }
  footer .foot-note{
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--cream-dim);
  }

  /* ---------- Floating WhatsApp button ---------- */
  .whatsapp-float{
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    z-index: 60;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: #25D366;
    color: #0b1a10;
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 13px 20px 13px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }
  .whatsapp-float:hover, .whatsapp-float:focus-visible{ transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .whatsapp-float svg{ flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* Card-level WhatsApp order link (distinct from the ember "inquire" style) */
  .card-cta-wa{
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #25D366;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #25D366;
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
  .card-cta-wa:hover, .card-cta-wa:focus-visible{ opacity: 0.75; }

  @media (max-width: 720px){
    .nav-links{ display: none; }
    .hero{ padding: 90px 0 70px; }
    .hero-stats{ grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
    section{ padding: 64px 0; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ============ NAV ============ -->
<header>
  <nav class="wrap">
    <a href="#top" class="brand">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Ikampu" class="brand-logo">
    </a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#catalog">Tents</a></li>
      <li><a href="#why">Why Ikampu</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Order</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<div id="top" class="hero">
  <!-- Topographic contour SVG texture, purely decorative -->
  <svg class="contour-bg" viewBox="0 0 1200 700" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <g fill="none" stroke="#8CA88A" stroke-width="1">
      <path d="M-50,600 C200,550 300,650 500,600 C700,550 800,620 1250,580" opacity="0.5"/>
      <path d="M-50,560 C220,500 320,600 520,550 C720,500 820,570 1250,530" opacity="0.4"/>
      <path d="M-50,520 C240,460 340,550 540,500 C740,450 840,520 1250,480" opacity="0.3"/>
      <path d="M-50,480 C260,420 360,500 560,450 C760,400 860,470 1250,430" opacity="0.2"/>
      <path d="M-50,150 C250,90 350,170 550,120 C750,70 850,140 1250,100" opacity="0.25"/>
      <path d="M-50,110 C270,50 370,130 570,80 C770,30 870,100 1250,60" opacity="0.15"/>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Fieldworthy tents · designed in the Highlands</div>
    <h1>Built for the ground <em>you actually sleep on.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      No showroom fantasy specs. Every Ikampu tent is pitched, rained on, and
      wind-loaded above treeline before it's ever listed. Pick the terrain — we've
      already built the tent for it.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#catalog" class="btn btn-primary">View the lineup</a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/254724512288?text=Hi%20Ikampu%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20book%20a%20tent" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-ghost">Book on WhatsApp</a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div>
        <div class="stat-num">6</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Models in stock</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="stat-num">-32°</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Coldest tested pitch</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="stat-num">120</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Km/h wind rating, top model</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Contour divider between hero and catalog -->
<svg class="contour-divider" viewBox="0 0 1200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
  <path d="M0,30 C200,10 300,50 500,30 C700,10 800,45 1200,25 L1200,60 L0,60 Z" fill="#223225"/>
</svg>

<!-- ============ CATALOG ============ -->
<section id="catalog" class="catalog">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="section-title">Choose by terrain</div>
      </div>
      <p class="section-note">
        Each tag marks the elevation and terrain band a model is built for —
        that's the spec that actually decides which tent you need.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">

      <!-- Tent 1 -->
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card-top">
          <span class="terrain-badge">SEA LEVEL · COASTAL</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tent-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a4a52 0%, #223225 65%, #C9A876 100%);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 160 100" fill="none" stroke="#F3EEE0" stroke-width="1.6">
            <path d="M20 85 L80 20 L140 85 Z"/>
            <path d="M80 20 L80 85"/>
            <path d="M55 85 L80 55 L105 85"/>
            <path d="M5 88 Q40 82 80 88 T155 88" stroke="#8CA88A" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.7"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Driftline 2P</h3>
        <p class="desc">Light, breathable, and built to shed salt air. Our best-seller for beach and lowland car camping.</p>
        <div class="specs">
          <div><div class="spec-label">Capacity</div><div class="spec-val">2 persons</div></div>
          <div><div class="spec-label">Weight</div><div class="spec-val">2.1 kg</div></div>
          <div><div class="spec-label">Season</div><div class="spec-val">3-season</div></div>
          <div><div class="spec-label">Packed</div><div class="spec-val">44 × 15 cm</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer">
          <span class="price">KES 24,500</span>
          <a href="https://wa.me/254724512288?text=Hi%20Ikampu%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20buy%20the%20Driftline%202P%20tent" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card-cta-wa">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12c0 1.85.5 3.58 1.36 5.07L2 22l5.05-1.32A9.94 9.94 0 0012 22c5.52 0 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm5.2 14.2c-.22.6-1.28 1.16-1.77 1.2-.45.05-1 .07-1.62-.1-.37-.1-.85-.27-1.46-.53-2.57-1.1-4.25-3.7-4.38-3.87-.13-.17-1.05-1.39-1.05-2.65 0-1.26.66-1.88.9-2.13.22-.25.5-.3.66-.3h.48c.15 0 .36-.03.56.43.22.53.75 1.82.82 1.95.07.13.11.28.02.45-.09.17-.13.27-.26.42-.13.15-.28.33-.4.44-.13.13-.27.27-.12.53.15.26.66 1.1 1.42 1.78.98.87 1.8 1.14 2.06 1.27.26.13.41.11.56-.06.15-.17.65-.75.83-1.01.18-.26.35-.21.6-.13.24.09 1.53.72 1.79.85.26.13.44.2.5.31.07.11.07.65-.15 1.25z"/></svg>
            Buy on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Tent 2 -->
      <article class="card">
        <div class="card-top">
          <span class="terrain-badge">800–1500M · FOREST</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tent-icon" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1c2e21 0%, #28392F 60%, #2f4636 100%);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 160 100" fill="none" stroke="#F3EEE0" stroke-width="1.6">
            <path d="M15 88 Q80 20 145 88 Z"/>
            <path d="M80 88 Q80 45 80 25"/>
            <path d="M10 30 L10 88 M150 30 L150 88" stroke="#8CA88A" stroke-width="1.2" opacity="0.6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Understory 3P</h3>
        <p class="desc">A domed profile that sheds falling branches and rain equally well. Roomy enough for a family trailhead trip.</p>
        <div class="specs">
          <div><div class="spec-label">Capacity</div><div class="spec-val">3 persons</div></div>
          <div><div class="spec-label">Weight</div><div class="spec-val">3.4 kg</div></div>
          <div><div class="spec-label">Season</div><div class="spec-val">3-season</div></div>
          <div><div class="spec-label">Packed</div><div class="spec-val">50 × 18 cm</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer">
